  "content": {
    "id": "p10-q2-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "A ball is thrown from the origin with speed 20 m/s at $30^\\circ$. Derive the six equations of motion and write $\\underset{\\sim}{v}$ in vector form.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$a_x=0$, $a_y=-10$; $v_x=10\\sqrt3$, $v_y=10-10t$; $x=10\\sqrt3t$, $y=10t-5t^2$. Thus $\\underset{\\sim}{v}=10\\sqrt3\\mathbf i+(10-10t)\\mathbf j\\text{ m s}^{-1}$. Accelerations are in m/s² and displacements in metres, with $t$ in seconds.",
      "worked": {
        "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "p10-q2-answer-columns",
            "type": "layout",
            "arrangement": "parallel",
            "title": "",
            "border": false,
            "padding": 3,
            "margin": 3,
            "gap": 3,
            "columns": 2,
            "slots": [
              {
                "id": "p10-q2-answer-derivation-slot",
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "id": "p10-q2-answer-derivation",
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "fontSize": null,
                    "align": "right",
                    "spaceBefore": 0,
                    "spaceAfter": 2,
                    "lineHeight": 1.4,
                    "indent": 0,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "type": "math",
                        "latex": "\\begin{aligned}u_x&=20\\cos30^\\circ=10\\sqrt3\\\\u_y&=20\\sin30^\\circ=10\\\\a_x&=0,\\qquad a_y=-10\\\\\\frac{dv_x}{dt}&=0\\\\v_x&=C_1\\\\v_x(0)&=10\\sqrt3\\\\C_1&=10\\sqrt3\\\\v_x&=\\boxed{10\\sqrt3}\\\\\\frac{dv_y}{dt}&=-10\\\\v_y&=-10t+C_2\\\\v_y(0)&=10\\\\C_2&=10\\\\v_y&=\\boxed{10-10t}\\\\\\frac{dx}{dt}&=v_x=10\\sqrt3\\\\x&=10\\sqrt3t+C_3\\\\x(0)&=0\\\\C_3&=0\\\\x&=\\boxed{10\\sqrt3t}\\\\\\frac{dy}{dt}&=v_y=10-10t\\\\y&=10t-5t^2+C_4\\\\y(0)&=0\\\\C_4&=0\\\\y&=\\boxed{10t-5t^2}\\end{aligned}",
                        "display": true,
                        "colour": "#268cff"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p10-q2-answer-summary-slot",
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "id": "p10-q2-answer-summary",
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "fontSize": null,
                    "align": "right",
                    "spaceBefore": 0,
                    "spaceAfter": 2,
                    "lineHeight": 1.4,
                    "indent": 0,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "type": "math",
                        "latex": "\\begin{aligned}a_x&=\\boxed{0}\\\\a_y&=\\boxed{-10}\\\\v_x&=\\boxed{10\\sqrt3}\\\\v_y&=\\boxed{10-10t}\\\\x&=\\boxed{10\\sqrt3t}\\\\y&=\\boxed{10t-5t^2}\\\\\\underset{\\sim}{v}&=\\boxed{10\\sqrt3\\mathbf i+(10-10t)\\mathbf j}\\end{aligned}",
                        "display": true,
                        "colour": "#268cff"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
